    {
      "id": "claim_f2753d7eeb624032a284a9e349e4fab8",
      "statement": "broker.py's three lifecycle measurements are made against varlock 1.16.1 — the version mise.toml pins as verified against this tree (2026-08-18) — and are not obvious from `--help`: `proxy start` does not daemonize (so the module spawns it detached and returns), the session id is read back from `proxy status --format json` matched on the chosen port rather than parsed from `start`'s ANSI-styled stdout, and `varlock` is invoked with `--path <schema_dir>` rather than by cwd because the mise shim resolves the binary only inside this repo.",
